  /* -----------------------------------------------------------------
     Thread builder.

     entries are compact triples so a 16-turn conversation stays readable:
       ['u', body, extra?]   user turn
       ['a', body, extra?]   assistant turn -- gets a full `runtime` block
       ['e', type, extra?]   system event (type must exist in app.js's
